# W27 aggregate gate. The gate's whole claim is that the image it scans is the image the release
# consumes. Neither of these paths exists in a CI checkout, but both are produced by W27 tooling
# inside the working tree, and `COPY . .` would otherwise bake them into a locally built release
# image: the committed evidence directory would be scanned as an SBOM artifact, and the transient
# upstream clone is 250 MB of source that is not part of the release. Excluding them keeps a local
# build byte-identical to the CI build instead of silently scanning something else.
w27-evidence
build/w27/seaweedfs
